{
  "_comment": "Curated agent CLIs for the Hall of Shame batch. Commands are safe --version/--help probes only. `network: false` (default) means: run only if the tool is already installed locally and do not give it a reason to talk (no prompt, no login). Entries with `network: true` are skipped unless run.sh gets --allow-network. Package names are UNVERIFIED suggestions: a human confirms each name and installs it (npm i --prefix hall/work <pkg>) before the first real run. Nothing here is a claim about any tool.",
